{"parentUuid":"8baf2465-fe3f-47dc-bfd5-b8c5e73f7be6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01B19MmjwEbeqWMLuvZ2NM2k","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented the foundational milestones of the plugin system from `docs/plugin-system-plan.md`: skeleton, dispatcher, CLI surface, local install, and exec — enough to install and run plugins end-to-end without the network-dependent paths.\n\n**New package** `cmd/entire/cli/plugin/`:\n- `manager.go` — `Manager`, `Plugin`, `Kind` (binary/script/local), `DefaultRoot()` honoring `ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DIR` then XDG, `List()`/`Find()` with classification\n- `manifest.go` — YAML `BinaryManifest` matching gh's schema field-for-field\n- `pin.go` — `.pin-<sha>` marker reader (writer comes with the upgrade milestone)\n- `dispatch.go` + `dispatch_unix.go` / `dispatch_windows.go` — `Dispatch(rootCmd, args)` that returns `(handled, err)`, built-in precedence via `rootCmd.Find()`, stdio inheritance, `ENTIRE_PLUGIN_DATA_DIR` injection, exit-code propagation. Windows routes script plugins through `sh.exe`\n- `install_local.go` — `entire plugin install <dir>` symlink path with conflict check against built-ins\n- `remove.go` — uninstall (symlinks unlinked without touching the source)\n\n**CLI wiring**:\n- `cmd/entire/cli/plugin_group.go` adds `entire plugin {install,list,remove,exec}`\n- `cmd/entire/cli/root.go` registers the group\n- `cmd/entire/main.go` calls `plugin.Dispatch` before `showSuggestion` and exits with the child's code\n\n**Tests** (all passing under `t.Parallel()` with `Manager{Root: t.TempDir()}` isolation):\n- Classification: binary/script/local, mixed root with noise entries\n- Dispatch: built-in shadowing, plugin execution, exit code 42 propagation, env injection, flag-skipping for first-positional, unknown plugin fall-through\n- Install: symlink, force, built-in conflict rejection, bad dir name\n- Remove: source dir untouched\n\n**Verified**: `mise run lint` (0 issues), `mise run test`, `mise run test:integration`, `mise run test:e2e:canary` all pass. Manual end-to-end: `entire plugin install` → `entire plugin list` → `entire <name>` works; built-in shadowing confirmed (`entire status` → built-in, `entire plugin exec status` → plugin).\n\n**Deferred** (per the plan, independently mergeable): GitHub release binary install, git-clone script install, upgrade, `create` scaffolding, search/browse/pin, update notifier, docs page. The `Plugin` and `Manager` types are designed to absorb these without API changes.\n\nNote: `go.mod` promotes `gopkg.in/yaml.v3` from indirect → direct."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":211,"cache_read_input_tokens":146235,"output_tokens":1008,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":211,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1008,"cache_read_input_tokens":146235,"cache_creation_input_tokens":211,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":211},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CajCs7TJ6CtmMpBTZtz73","type":"assistant","uuid":"ff42caaa-b2f5-4a09-a8a0-dc0075c30442","timestamp":"2026-05-05T09:43:57.230Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-cli","sessionId":"a1f70cf7-7a52-4ebc-865d-2e575c556160","version":"2.1.126","gitBranch":"ashtom/plugin-exploration"}
